  "script": "Manhwa Drop! This opening is wild. A normal subway ride is about to become an apocalypse. Kim Dokja has spent years reading an obscure web novel called Three Ways to Survive the Apocalypse. Almost nobody follows it, but he reads every chapter. Then he finally reaches the ending. A message pops up from the author, thanking him for sticking with the story, and warning that the novel becomes paid at exactly seven PM. Weird, right? Dokja shrugs it off. Then the clock flips to seven. The train slams. People start screaming. And something from the novel appears right in front of him. Here's the crazy part: Dokja may be the only person alive who already knows what happens next. That's Omniscient Reader.",
